    "Einmalig, kein Abo: 400 Hz, 4K, Kamerapose für 3D, Rohdaten, Blender, Sensor Logger, Gyroflow, mehrere Begehungen, GeoJSON/GPX/KML und der Gesamtexport. Der CSV-Export bleibt auch ohne Pro offen.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "One-time purchase, no subscription: 400 Hz, 4K, camera pose for 3D, raw data, Blender, Sensor Logger, Gyroflow, multiple surveys, GeoJSON/GPX/KML and the full export. CSV export stays open without Pro too."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Achat unique, sans abonnement : 400 Hz, 4K, pose de caméra pour la 3D, données brutes, Blender, Sensor Logger, Gyroflow, plusieurs parcours, GeoJSON/GPX/KML et l'export global. L'export CSV reste ouvert même sans Pro."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Acquisto unico, nessun abbonamento: 400 Hz, 4K, posa della fotocamera per il 3D, dati grezzi, Blender, Sensor Logger, Gyroflow, più percorsi, GeoJSON/GPX/KML e l'esportazione completa. L'esportazione CSV resta aperta anche senza Pro."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Compra única, sin suscripción: 400 Hz, 4K, pose de cámara para 3D, datos brutos, Blender, Sensor Logger, Gyroflow, varios recorridos, GeoJSON/GPX/KML y la exportación completa. La exportación CSV sigue abierta incluso sin Pro."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Eenmalig, geen abonnement: 400 Hz, 4K, camerapose voor 3D, ruwe data, Blender, Sensor Logger, Gyroflow, meerdere rondes, GeoJSON/GPX/KML en de volledige export. De CSV-export blijft ook zonder Pro open."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Compra única, sem assinatura: 400 Hz, 4K, pose da câmera para 3D, dados brutos, Blender, Sensor Logger, Gyroflow, vários percursos, GeoJSON/GPX/KML e a exportação completa. A exportação CSV continua aberta mesmo sem o Pro."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "買い切り、サブスクリプションではありません。400 Hz、4K、3D 用カメラポーズ、生データ、Blender、Sensor Logger、Gyroflow、複数の巡回、GeoJSON/GPX/KML、一括書き出し。CSV 書き出しは Pro なしでも使えます。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "일회성 구매, 구독 아님: 400 Hz, 4K, 3D용 카메라 포즈, 원시 데이터, Blender, Sensor Logger, Gyroflow, 여러 순회, GeoJSON/GPX/KML, 전체 내보내기. CSV 내보내기는 Pro 없이도 열려 있습니다."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "一次買斷，並非訂閱：400 Hz、4K、3D 用相機姿態、原始資料、Blender、Sensor Logger、Gyroflow、多條巡查路線、GeoJSON/GPX/KML 與整體匯出。即使沒有 Pro，CSV 匯出仍然開放。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
